WEBVTT

00:22:28.958 --> 00:22:31.268
So now comes the question,
how do we build it?

00:22:31.292 --> 00:22:32.768
How do we rebuild it?

00:22:32.792 --> 00:22:35.851
And what is the impact
of the breach of trust,

00:22:35.875 --> 00:22:39.434
which today becomes
almost a loss of identity?

00:22:39.458 --> 00:22:41.976
I thought I knew what I am here

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.559
and who we are together here.

00:22:43.583 --> 00:22:45.893
And I said that
about romantic relationships,

00:22:45.917 --> 00:22:49.434
but I have experienced it
with the partners in business, no less.

00:22:49.458 --> 00:22:52.393
AG: Yeah, so let's
start on the repair side.

00:22:52.417 --> 00:22:54.101
In some cases it's harder,

00:22:54.125 --> 00:22:57.143
but I think the dynamics
are sometimes a little bit simpler.

00:22:57.167 --> 00:23:00.268
So my reader research
on trust repair says that,